            "tender": {
                "id": "RM6249/DIPS(2) 036",
                "title": "DDAP Enablement Partner",
                "description": "The Defence Data Analytics Platform (DDAP) initiative has evolved significantly since its inception, with continuous change, ensuring that the platform is able to scale to meet the requirements of our end users. By continuously evolving the platform, we ensure that DDAP remains at the forefront of data and AI innovation, maximizing the value extracted from data assets. \r\n\r\nThis approach has led to substantial uptake from the user community with recent adoption by major programmes and operational use highlighting the ability of DDAP to deliver high-value outcomes effectively.\r\n\r\nWe seek a supplier to evolve and support the Defence Data Analytics Platform (DDAP), to ensure it can continue in its development and support operations whilst aligning with the Data Fabric and the Data Strategy for Defence.\r\n\r\nThe contract value is up to £50,000,000.\r\n\r\nThis contract was awarded via the DIPS framework.",
